Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.04,0:01:31.93,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}玩《最后生还者》还太早呢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.23,0:01:33.91,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}今天的日子 也很快会成为纪念日
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.01,0:01:35.55,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}步步为营虎视眈眈
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.55,0:01:36.85,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}狠狠地咬住不放吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:38.14,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}就保持扑克脸
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.14,0:01:39.57,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}继续前进吧
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.10,0:01:42.44,op zh,tag,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\3c&H000000&\3a&H00&\bord1\blur3}还是一如既往地狂妄自大
